A high-angle, full shot captures a young man lying on a light-colored rug on a wooden floor, completely wrapped in a thick, beige textured blanket. He is lying on his back with his eyes closed, appearing to be asleep or resting deeply. His dark hair is visible against the floor, and his face is partially visible from the nose down. To his right, a black smartphone with a red case lies on the floor. The room is sparsely furnished with several items scattered around him, including a white floor lamp base, a small white appliance, a yellow rug, and two bright green floor cushions. The lighting is soft and even, creating a calm and quiet atmosphere. The color palette is dominated by neutral tones of beige, white, and light wood, punctuated by the vibrant green of the cushions and the small pop of red from the phone case.